  "idea": "Typeform vs Tally: comparing the sleek form builder with the free challenger",
  "text": "Typeform vs Tally: why pay thirty dollars a month when Tally gives you ninety-nine percent for free? Growing teams hit harsh response paywalls on Typeform, blocking new leads until upgrading expensive tiers. Basic essentials like custom domains, file uploads, and conditional logic stay locked behind recurring paywalls. Tally delivers unlimited form submissions, native Notion embedding, and zero-fee Stripe checkouts completely free. You capture qualified client leads without bloated overhead.",
